    "created_at": "2019-01-09T02:59:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-09T02:59:28Z",
    "body": "We've been looking at this for Chrome. Our tentative plan is to create a new API called WebSocketStream. This avoids confusion over what should happen if you use the new streaming API and the old event-based API at the same time. It also lets us fix the \"default `binaryType` is `blob`\" issue.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
