    "created_at": "2019-01-09T09:42:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-09T09:42:21Z",
    "body": "If that ends up being a thing, perhaps we should take that as an opportunity to create `websocket.spec.whatwg.org` and move the current API and https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#websocket-protocol there, as well as this new API.",
